    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you reach a Paladin level specified in the Genie Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.</p><div style=\"width: 100%;\"><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><caption>Oath of the Noble Genie Spells</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Paladin Level</th><th scope=\"col\">Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3rd</td><td>Chromatic Orb, Elementalism, Thunderous Smite</td></tr><tr><td>5th</td><td>Mirror Image, Phantasmal Force</td></tr><tr><td>9th</td><td>Fly, Gaseous Form</td></tr><tr><td>13th</td><td>Conjure Minor Elementals, Summon Elemental</td></tr><tr><td>17th</td><td>Banishing Smite, Contact Other Plane</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
